  "Hakuna historia inayoonyeshwa mpaka utafute. Andika namba ya invoice au jina la mteja; Sales invoices zinaweza kufunguliwa, na Selling Point bills zinaweza kuchapishwa tena.": { sw: "Hakuna historia inayoonyeshwa mpaka utafute. Andika namba ya invoice au jina la mteja; Sales invoices zinaweza kufunguliwa, na Selling Point bills zinaweza kuchapishwa tena.", en: "No history is shown until you search. Enter an invoice number or customer name; Sales invoices can be opened, and Selling Point bills can be reprinted." },
