  "Bili itabatilishwa na stock itarudishwa. Rekodi na namba ya invoice vitahifadhiwa.": { sw: "Bili itabatilishwa na stock itarudishwa. Rekodi na namba ya invoice vitahifadhiwa.", en: "The bill will be voided and stock will be returned. The record and invoice number will be kept." },
