  "Invoices za mauzo, malipo ya wateja, sales returns, bili za wateja, mauzo ya Selling Point, madeni ya kuanzia ya wateja (opening balance), PAMOJA na ripoti zake zote (journals za mauzo, historia ya stock ya mauzo, ripoti za kipindi). Ukichagua Sales peke yake, idadi ya stock inarudishwa kama mauzo hayajawahi kutokea; ukichagua pia Stock au Products, vyote vinafutwa. Hakuna kinachobaki.": { sw: "Invoices za mauzo, malipo ya wateja, sales returns, bili za wateja, mauzo ya Selling Point, madeni ya kuanzia ya wateja (opening balance), PAMOJA na ripoti zake zote (journals za mauzo, historia ya stock ya mauzo, ripoti za kipindi). Ukichagua Sales peke yake, idadi ya stock inarudishwa kama mauzo hayajawahi kutokea; ukichagua pia Stock au Products, vyote vinafutwa. Hakuna kinachobaki.", en: "Sales invoices, customer payments, sales returns, customer bills, Selling Point sales, customers' opening debts (opening balance), TOGETHER WITH all their reports (sales journals, sales stock history, period reports). If you choose Sales alone, stock quantities are restored as if the sales never happened; if you also choose Stock or Products, all of them are deleted. Nothing remains." },
  "Manunuzi, purchase orders, GRN, malipo ya suppliers na purchase returns, madeni ya kuanzia ya suppliers (opening balance), PAMOJA na ripoti zake zote (journals za manunuzi, historia ya stock ya manunuzi, ripoti za kipindi). Hakuna kinachobaki.": { sw: "Manunuzi, purchase orders, GRN, malipo ya suppliers na purchase returns, madeni ya kuanzia ya suppliers (opening balance), PAMOJA na ripoti zake zote (journals za manunuzi, historia ya stock ya manunuzi, ripoti za kipindi). Hakuna kinachobaki.", en: "Purchases, purchase orders, GRN, supplier payments and purchase returns, suppliers' opening debts (opening balance), TOGETHER WITH all their reports (purchase journals, purchase stock history, period reports). Nothing remains." },
